cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below and cite
  the accompanying article when it is published.
type: software
title: >-
  Gate-aware importance sampling for a frozen neural binary neutron star
  posterior in the presence of glitches
abstract: >-
  Reweights samples from a frozen DINGO-BNS checkpoint with the gated Gaussian
  likelihood, and trusts a result only when the effective sample size is at
  least 100. Audits that rule on the public GW170817 checkpoint with real
  Gravity Spy glitches. Supersedes v1.2.0, whose gate recoveries were artefacts
  of a missing +2 s cyclic time shift.
